#: rc.cpp:8034
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Bode Frequency Shifter</b> (LADSPA 1431)<br>\n"
"   A Bode/Moog Frequency Shifter is a popular analogue synth module that "
"works by shifting all the frequencies of an input signal up or down by a "
"specified frequency. This effect shifts in both directions at the same time "
"as it is almost no extra work and is often useful to have both directions. "
"In contrast to the analogue Bode/Moog, which use Dome filters as the core, "
"it uses a Hilbert Transformer, which is much simpler to implement in digital "
